<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brilliance China raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brilliance China raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Monday it had raised its rating on Brilliance China Automotive Holdings Ltd to near-term buy from near-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- Merrill kept Brilliance China's long-term neutral rating unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Brilliance China shares closed at 4-1/4 Friday in New York.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
